# State contains API key tokens in plaintext. Never commit it.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
# The environment-promotion pattern IS the two tfvars files — the whole point is
# that dev and prod differ in data rather than in a forked configuration, which
# you cannot see if the data is ignored. Both hold environment names, regions,
# search attributes and tags. No credentials, and none should ever be added:
# put secrets in TF_VAR_* or a secret manager, not here.
!patterns/01-environment-promotion/envs/dev.tfvars
!patterns/01-environment-promotion/envs/prod.tfvars
crash.log
